andidate\u2019s strengths (e.g., D\u2019s responsibility and problem\u2011solving) outweigh their interpersonal weaknesses, or that B\u2019s communication problems have led to operational issues, I would reassess.\nMETADATA_JSON:\n{\"agent\": \"agent_3\", \"vote\": \"Candidate B\"}"}
