ty and overall reliability for long\u2011distance flights, and I have no data on whether B\u2019s grumpiness/uncooperativeness has ever led to crew\u2011related issues.\n**What would change my vote:** Clear evidence that either A or D possesses strong stress resilience and proven reliability for long\u2011distance operations, or that B\u2019s interpersonal issues have resulted in operational problems, would shift my preference toward another candidate.\nMETADATA_JSON:\n{\"agent\": \"agent_1\", \"vote\": \"Undecided\"}"}
